// Sparkle auto-update settings.
//
// Included from Release.xcconfig only. Debug builds therefore get an empty
// SPARKLE_FEED_URL, SparkleUpdater.swift reports `configured: false`, and the
// menu item greys out — which is what you want while developing, since a debug
// build must never replace itself with a release one.
//
// SPARKLE_PUBLIC_ED_KEY is the ed25519 *public* key; it is public by
// definition and belongs in version control. Its private half lives in the
// release engineer's login Keychain (see tool/publish_appcast.sh).
//
// Changing either of these changes what an installed copy will accept as a
// valid update. Do not edit casually.

// xcconfig treats "//" as a comment ANYWHERE on a line, including inside a
// value — so writing the URL literally silently truncates it to "https:" and
// every update check fails against a malformed URL. Build the slashes from a
// variable so the two characters are never adjacent in the source text.
// (Verify with: PlistBuddy -c 'Print :SUFeedURL' on the built Info.plist.)
//
// The host is asdl.serverpod.dev — the Cloud CDN in front of the release bucket,
// not the bucket's own storage.googleapis.com URL. This value is COMPILED IN, so
// changing it only ever affects copies built afterwards: every already-installed
// App Studio keeps polling whatever URL it shipped with. The old bucket URL
// therefore has to keep serving the same feed forever, and does — the CDN is a
// second way to reach one bucket, not a move. Retiring that URL would strand
// every install made before this line changed.
SPARKLE_SLASH = /
SPARKLE_FEED_URL = https:$(SPARKLE_SLASH)$(SPARKLE_SLASH)asdl.serverpod.dev/appcast/macos/appcast.xml

// The ed25519 public key. Its private half is in the release engineer's login
// Keychain — see "Back up the signing key" in AGENTS.md. Changing this value
// invalidates every update signed with the old key, and losing the private key
// makes every already-installed copy permanently un-updatable.
SPARKLE_PUBLIC_ED_KEY = isULE6yi+oglEsXdoR0/8H32mvVddMKN7MCr8pFqChk=
